  </div>
  <div class="confirmed-item">
    <div class="ci-title">美狮美高梅 · 视博广场</div>
    <div class="ci-meta">路氹体育馆大马路 · 飞天企鹅 + 圣诞森林 · <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=美狮美高梅" target="_blank" rel="noopener">导航</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="confirmed-item">
    <div class="ci-title">澳门美高梅 · 天幕广场（半岛）</div>
    <div class="ci-meta">半岛孙逸仙大马路 · 金色圣诞灯塔 + 蓝白瓷砖圣诞树 · <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=澳门美高梅" target="_blank" rel="noopener">导航</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="confirmed-item">
    <div class="ci-title">新濠影汇 DONKI</div>
