  </div>
</div>

<!-- 4. 逐日行程 -->
<div class="card">
  <div class="day-head" onclick="toggleDay()">
    <h2>11月21日 · 周六</h2>
    <span class="day-toggle" id="dayToggle">展开路线 ▾</span>
  </div>

  <div class="day-map" id="dayMap">
    <div class="map-wrap">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 340 90" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <g font-size="9" font-family="-apple-system, sans-serif" text-anchor="middle">
          <!-- 横向链条示意 -->
          <line x1="30" y1="45" x2="310" y2="45" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3" opacity=".6"/>
          <circle cx="40" cy="45" r="5" fill="var(--accent)"/><text x="40" y="62" fill="var(--text)">关闸</text>
          <circle cx="100" cy="45" r="5" fill="#e08a63"/><text x="100" y="62" fill="var(--text)">巴黎人</text>
          <circle cx="150" cy="45" r="4" fill="#b5835a"/><text x="150" y="62" fill="var(--muted)">Blo oom</text>
          <circle cx="200" cy="45" r="5" fill="#c96f4a"/><text x="200" y="62" fill="var(--text)">美狮美高梅</text>
          <circle cx="250" cy="45" r="4" fill="#d4a373"/><text x="250" y="62" fill="var(--muted)">新濠影汇</text>
          <circle cx="300" cy="45" r="5" fill="#e08a63"/><text x="300" y="62" fill="var(--text)">澳门美高梅</text>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <a class="day-nav-btn" href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=关闸+澳门&destination=关闸+澳门&waypoints=澳门巴黎人|Blooom+Coffee+葡京人|美狮美高梅|新濠影汇|澳门美高梅" target="_blank" rel="noopener">一键打开全天多点导航</a>
  </div>

  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-time">10:00–12:00</div>
      <div class="tl-body">
        <div class="tl-title">大巴 深圳 → 拱北</div>
        <div class="tl-desc">大剧院C口上车，经车公庙、深大，约12:00抵拱北</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-time">12:00–12:40</div>
      <div class="tl-body">
        <div class="tl-title">拱北过关</div>
        <div class="tl-desc">周六中午，预留40分钟缓冲</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-time">12:40–13:10</div>
      <div class="tl-body">
        <div class="tl-title">关闸 → 巴黎人</div>
        <div class="tl-desc"><strong>粉色发财车</strong>（巴黎人专属），约20分钟一班，车程约20分钟。<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=关闸+澳门&destination=澳门巴黎人" target="_blank" rel="noopener">导航</a></div>
        <span class="walk-note">下车即巴黎人B1层停车场，乘电梯到大堂</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-time">13:10–14:20</div>
      <div class="tl-body">
        <div class="tl-title">巴黎人 · 圣诞树 + 铁塔 <span class="badge">核心拍照</span></div>
        <div class="tl-desc">17米倒挂圣诞树在大堂；铁塔红色领结在户外。<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=澳门巴黎人" target="_blank" rel="noopener">导航</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-time">14:20–14:30</div>
      <div class="tl-body">
        <div class="tl-title">巴黎人 → 葡京人 Blo oom</div>
        <div class="tl-desc"><strong>步行约10分钟</strong>，或打车约3分钟。从巴黎人正门出，沿路氹连贯公路向葡京人方向走。<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=澳门巴黎人&destination=Blooom+Coffee+葡京人" target="_blank" rel="noopener">导航</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-time">14:30–15:30</div>
      <div class="tl-body">
        <div class="tl-title">Blo oom（葡京人店） <span class="badge">核心执念</span></div>
        <div class="tl-desc">H853 Fun Factory 娱乐小镇 1楼 R18铺。<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Blooom+Coffee+葡京人+澳门" target="_blank" rel="noopener">导航</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-time">15:30–15:50</div>
      <div class="tl-body">
        <div class="tl-title">葡京人 → 美狮美高梅</div>
        <div class="tl-desc"><strong>步行约20分钟</strong>。<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=Blooom+Coffee+葡京人&destination=美狮美高梅" target="_blank" rel="noopener">导航</a></div>
        <span class="walk-note">路径：葡京人大堂正门右转 → 直走至射击路过马路 → 过马路后左转 → 沿右手边永利皇宫草坪直走 → 见美高梅过马路即正门</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-time">15:50–16:50</div>
      <div class="tl-body">
        <div class="tl-title">美狮美高梅 · 视博广场 <span class="badge">圣诞拍照</span></div>
        <div class="tl-desc">飞天企鹅 + 圣诞森林 + 发光星星。<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=美狮美高梅" target="_blank" rel="noopener">导航</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-time">16:50–17:00</div>
      <div class="tl-body">
        <div class="tl-title">美狮美高梅 → 新濠影汇</div>
        <div class="tl-desc"><strong>步行约5–10分钟</strong>，紧邻。<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=美狮美高梅&destination=新濠影汇" target="_blank" rel="noopener">导航</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-time">17:00–17:50</div>
      <div class="tl-body">
        <div class="tl-title">新濠影汇 · DONKI</div>
        <div class="tl-desc">周六 09:00–02:00。<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=DONKI+新濠影汇" target="_blank" rel="noopener">导航</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-time">17:50–18:10</div>
      <div class="tl-body">
        <div class="tl-title">新濠影汇 → 澳门美高梅（半岛）</div>
        <div class="tl-desc"><strong>亮橙色美高梅穿梭巴士</strong>，约15分钟一班，车程约15–20分钟。<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=新濠影汇&destination=澳门美高梅" target="_blank" rel="noopener">导航</a></div>
        <span class="walk-note">在新濠影汇穿梭巴士站找亮橙色车身、印美高梅狮子 logo 的车</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-time">18:10–19:00</div>
      <div class="tl-body">
        <div class="tl-title">澳门美高梅 · 天幕广场 <span class="badge">圣诞拍照</span></div>
        <div class="tl-desc">金色圣诞灯塔 + 蓝白瓷砖圣诞树，亮灯后氛围最好。<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=澳门美高梅" target="_blank" rel="noopener">导航</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-time">19:00–19:20</div>
